{"ref":"BDB, שָׁפָן²","hw":"שָׁפָן²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁפָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Σαφ(φ)αν:<br><strong>1.</strong>  secretary <span dir=\"rtl\">(הַסֹּפֵר)</span> under Josiah <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.3\">2 K 22:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.10\">10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.8\">2 Ch 34:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.20\">20</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיקָם</span>, contemp. of <strong>1</strong> (improb. = <strong>1</strong>): <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">2 K 22:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.22\">25:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.24\">Je 26:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.14\">39:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.5\">40:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.2\">41:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.6\">43:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.20\">2 Ch 34:20</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  father of <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְעָשָׂה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.3\">Je 29:3</a>, perhaps = <strong>2</strong>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  father of <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמַרְיָ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.10\">36:10</a> (called <span dir=\"rtl\">הַסֹּפֵר</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.12\">12</a>, perhaps = <strong>1.</strong><br><strong>5.</strong>  father of <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲזַנְיָ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.11\">Ez 8:11</a>, possibly = <strong>1.</strong>","next":"BDB, שׁוֹפָן","prev":"BDB, שָׁפָן"}